sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant A as Aggregator<br/>(global model)
    participant K as Clients (N shards)

    C->>A: run(clients, rounds)
    A->>K: create shard group

    loop each round (until early stop)
        A->>K: train_round(global weights)
        K->>K: generate local data,<br/>train logistic regression
        K-->>A: gradients + loss + sample count
        A->>A: FedAvg, clip gradients,<br/>add DP noise, update model
        A->>A: check accuracy on test data
    end

    A-->>C: final accuracy, loss, timing
